:: MP Livelihood Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
高街布告栏最下面一排钉着几张补充说明：六家铺子的长期班次各自在店门口招人，这里只留零工与季节招工的纸条。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[查看零工备忘 (0:03)|MP Extra Jobs Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
纸条背面用铅笔写着一行小字：每条路线的班次一天只算一次；做得久了，东家才会记住你。

:: MP Job Cafe [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 7 and Time.hour lt 21)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开咖啡馆 (0:02)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobCafeExp to ($mpJobCafeExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobCafeLevel to ($mpJobCafeExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
门上铜铃响了一半。咖啡机喷出第一股白汽，<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把一条洗得发白的围裙搭在吧台上，抬下巴示意你系好。窗边空杯还没收。
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobCafe>>
你身上的咖啡味还没散，围裙已经挂回了后厨的钩子。<<elseif ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 3>>
吧台最里侧那只杯子是留给你的。<<else>>
<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>用粉笔在排班表上划了一横：「午市缺人，先把窗边那四桌照看好。」
<</if>>
<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobCafe)>>
	<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Cafe Winter">><<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Cafe Rain">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "winter">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Cafe Winter">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Cafe Festival">>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	露台的椅子都搬进来了，过道比平时窄，杯碟更容易碰响。
<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>
	最后一桌客人还不肯走，<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把打烊牌翻过来又放下。
<</if>>
<<if ($upperwet or 0) gte 1>>
	你衬衫底下湿了一片，<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>从后厨扔来一条干布。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_farm_bread")>>
		<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>送来的新麦粉堆在后厨，烘出的司康麦香格外浓郁。<<money 900>><<stress -2>>
	<<else>>
		后厨备着河湾农场直供的新麦粉，今日烤出的茶点很受熟客欢迎。
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_fish_special")>>
		海礁鱼档送来挑好的小银鱼，<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>让你写进今日特餐牌。
		<<money 750>><<stress -1>>
	<<else>>
		黑板特餐牌上写着海礁鲜鱼三明治，点单的客人络绎不绝。
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 6>>后厨点心架上码着丰收街石炉面包房清晨直供的黄油牛角包与司康胚。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 6>>街巷跑腿行的学徒正在侧门交接报馆与商行预订的下午茶外送提篮。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Cafe">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Cafe">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobCafeSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>没把围裙递过来。
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[找格威岚说理 (0:03)|MP Job Punishment Cafe 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobCafe)>>
	<<mptailoricon>><<link [[系围裙上工 (1:00)|MP Job Cafe Shift]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[翻看熟客名册 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe Upgrade]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
咖啡馆已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Cafe Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobCafeSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Cafe">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobCafeExp to ($mpJobCafeExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobCafeLevel to ($mpJobCafeExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobCafeLevel gte 2>><<set $mpJobCafeRegular to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobCafeLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobCafePenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobCafePerk to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobCafeLevel gte 4 and ($mpJobCafePenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobCafeKey to 1>><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回咖啡吧台 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobCafe>>
	咖啡馆今日的班次已经交接完毕，吧台擦得锃亮。
<<else>>
	午后的客人一波接一波涌进来。托盘边沿烫手，奶泡在杯口晃出细小的弧。<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>在吧台后头也不抬地报出桌号，手边的铜铃被碰得叮当响。
	<<set _supplyBonus to ((($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 120 : 0) + (($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 120 : 0) + (($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 6 ? 100 : 0))>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 200 or ($science or 0) gte 200 or ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link [[慢萃手冲 (1:00)|MP Job Cafe Settle]]>><<set _skill to Math.max(($housekeeping or 0), ($science or 0))>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 250 or ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2 or random(160, 260) lte (_skill + ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) * 35))>><<set $mpJobCafeExp to ($mpJobCafeExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobCafeLevel to ($mpJobCafeExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _tier to (_skill gte 320 or ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 4 ? 3 : (_skill gte 260 or ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 2 : 1))>><<set _pay to 4 * (310 + _tier * 35 + ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) * 75 + Math.floor(_skill / 5)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你按小壶、中壶、大壶分三段控温慢注，深烘豆油脂凝成琥珀色金圈，配上面包房的热司康送到二号桌，温特斯用杯垫轻敲两下，留下整张优厚赏钞。" : "你稳稳控住细嘴铜壶的水流，萃出的黑咖啡香气醇正，客人满意地点头收下。")>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 2>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_1 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_1 or 0) + 1>><<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_lv3")>><<money 4800>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "水温高了一截，冲出的咖啡又苦又涩，客人抿了一口便推开杯子，这班没能算工钱。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafe to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[慢萃手冲 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "慢萃手冲">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 3>><<link [[端盘穿堂 (1:00)|MP Job Cafe Settle]]>><<set _skill to ($tending or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 260 or ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 3 or random(160, 270) lte (_skill + ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobCafeExp to ($mpJobCafeExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobCafeLevel to ($mpJobCafeExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (320 + ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) * 70 + Math.floor(_skill / 6) + (($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 60 : 0)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你侧身让过突然后仰的椅背，托盘稳稳落在桌角。客人把几枚铜板压在杯垫底下，没有出声。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<tending 2>><<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_lv3")>><<money 4800>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "拐角处有人猛地起身，你为了护住杯子撞翻整只托盘。瓷片在砖地上炸开。" + ((mpNpcMet("Gwylan")) ? "格威岚" : "杂货店主") + "摆摆手，让你先把碎瓷扫干净，这班没有工钱。">><<stress 6>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafe to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[端盘穿堂 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "端盘穿堂">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已在吧台独当一面）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpdrinkicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 3>><<link [[调一杯特调 (1:00)|MP Job Cafe Settle]]>><<set _skill to ($seductionskill or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 260 or ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 3 or random(160, 270) lte (_skill + ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobCafeExp to ($mpJobCafeExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobCafeLevel to ($mpJobCafeExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (360 + ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) * 80 + Math.floor(_skill / 5) + (($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 60 : 0)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你记得那位常客不加糖，杯沿转了半圈才推过去。对方留下整张小费，指尖在杯垫边缘停了停。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 2>><<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_lv3_keepsake")>><<money 4800>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "糖浆挤多了，客人抿一口就皱眉推开杯子。吧台前安静了一瞬，你低头去擦那片水渍。">><<stress 6>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafe to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[调一杯特调 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "调一杯特调">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已在吧台独当一面）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[擦杯备料 (1:00)|MP Job Cafe Settle]]>><<set $mpJobCafeExp to ($mpJobCafeExp or 0) + 1>><<set $mpJobCafeLevel to ($mpJobCafeExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<set _pay to 4 * (260 + ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) * 50) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你把杯子一只只擦干，按大小码回架子。后厨的热气贴着后背，至少没人打翻东西。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 1>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafe to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Cafe Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Cafe">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobCafeExp to ($mpJobCafeExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobCafeLevel to ($mpJobCafeExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobCafeLevel gte 2>><<set $mpJobCafeRegular to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobCafeLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobCafePenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobCafePerk to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobCafeLevel gte 4 and ($mpJobCafePenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobCafeKey to 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpJobResultText>>
	<<print $mpJobResultText>>
	<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
		约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor($mpJobResultPay / 100)>></span> 已经进了你的口袋。
		<br><br>
		<<if !$mpJobResultMilestone and (($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) lte ($mpJobCafeLastLevel or 0))>><<if random(1, 3) is 1 and (Time.season is "spring" or Time.season is "summer")>><<if Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Cafe Spring">><<else>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Cafe Summer">><</if>><<else>><<set _rj to random(1, 3)>><<if _rj is 1>><<include "MP Job Random Cafe">><<elseif _rj is 2>><<include "MP Job Random Cafe 1">><<else>><<include "MP Job Random Cafe 2">><</if>><</if>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobCafeStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobCafeStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobCafeStrike - 1)>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gt ($mpJobCafeLastLevel or 0)>>
			<br><br>
			<<if $mpJobCafeLevel is 1>><<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>开始让你独自看窗边四桌，客人点单时会先看向你。<<elseif $mpJobCafeLevel is 2>>熟客名册上多了一个圈，<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>让你试着调一杯简单的。<<elseif $mpJobCafeLevel is 3>>午市最忙的时候，吧台交给你看。<<elseif $mpJobCafeLevel is 4>>后门钥匙挂到了你的围裙内侧。<<else>><<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把后厨与账柜的备用钥匙推到你手边，算是认下了你这位合伙人。<</if>>
			<<set $mpJobCafeLastLevel to $mpJobCafeLevel>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $mpJobResultMilestone>>
			<br><br>
			打烊前，<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把你叫到吧台尽头，往你手里塞了一只牛皮纸包的红封。
			<<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobCafeEncounter)>>
			吧台上的传呼铜铃忽然连响两声，窗边熟客正朝你招手。
			<br>
			<<investigateicon>><<link [[吧台铜铃又响 (0:05)|MP Job Cafe Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<mpreadicon>><<link [[翻看熟客名册 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe Upgrade]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>>		<<getouticon>><<link [[返回吧台前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobCafeStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobCafeStrike or 0) + 1)>><<if $mpJobCafeStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobCafeSuspended to 1>><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $mpJobCafeStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Cafe 1">><<elseif $mpJobCafeStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Cafe 2">><<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Cafe 3">><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link "去吧台认罚 (0:03)">><<set _pun to "MP Job Punishment Cafe " + ($mpJobCafeStrike or 1)>><<pass 3>><<goto _pun>><</link>>
		<br>
				<<link [[返回吧台前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<<else>>
	你已经交过班了。后厨的水池还温着，围裙搭在钩子上，没人再来催你。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Cafe Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobCafeExp to ($mpJobCafeExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobCafeLevel to ($mpJobCafeExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCafeExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
你坐在吧台最里侧，<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把账本转过来，指尖点在一排歪歪扭扭的名字上。纸页边缘有咖啡渍，也有几枚被指甲掐出的记号。
<br><br>
<<if $mpJobCafeLevel is 0>>
	你还在记桌号。<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把窗边四桌圈给你，说先把热汤端稳，再谈别的。
<<elseif $mpJobCafeLevel is 1>>
	你已经能看住窗边四桌。客人开始在你经过时抬手，而不是先喊<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>。
<<elseif $mpJobCafeLevel is 2>>
	熟客名册上有人在你名字旁画了圈。
<<elseif $mpJobCafeLevel is 3>>
	午市忙起来时，<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>会把吧台交给你看。
<<elseif $mpJobCafeLevel is 4>>
	后门钥匙挂在围裙内侧。
<<else>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把账本推给你，说这间店有你一份。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2 and ($mpJobCafePenalty or 0) is 0>>熟客名册上已经有三个人在你的名字旁画了圈。<<else>>名册上还没有你的名字。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobCafePenalty or 0) is 0>>灶台边那只缺口的杯子归你用，咖啡不要钱。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 4 and ($mpJobCafePenalty or 0) is 0>>后门钥匙挂在围裙内侧，铜齿被磨得发亮。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Cafe">>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回吧台帮忙 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看吧台当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobCafeExp or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryCafe or 0) lt 3>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[拼合船歌谱 (0:06)|MP Job Story Cafe 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Job Fish [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 5 or Time.hour lt 2)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开海礁鱼档 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">><<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>><</if>>
<<set $mpJobFishExp to ($mpJobFishExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobFishLevel to ($mpJobFishExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFishExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFishExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFishExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFishExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
退潮后的木栈桥还挂着水珠。老鱼贩把一筐碎冰拖到秤边，朝礁石方向抬了抬下巴。你的旧竿靠在缆桩上，导环有一处用铜丝缠过。
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobFish>>
你的桶已经空了，竿也收进了棚子。<<elseif ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 3>>
夜钓灯已经充好电，缠着新麻绳的加固竿靠在最顺手的位置。<<else>>
鱼贩踢了踢脚边的饵桶：「近岸的网先下，礁石那边浪大，自己看着办。」
<</if>>
<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobFish)>>
	<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Fish Winter">><<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Fish Rain">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "winter">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Fish Winter">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Fish Festival">>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	海面像一块灰布，鱼贩说这种天色鱼咬钩轻。
<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>
	夜里的潮声比白天清楚，远处灯塔的光扫过水面。
<</if>>
<<if ($upperwet or 0) gte 1>>
	裤脚湿透，海风一吹，膝盖有点发僵。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2>>
	鱼贩说海风咖啡馆订了今天的鲜鱼，让你把匀称的小银鱼单独挑出来。
	<<stress -1>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) gte 6>>
	梅尔街酒馆后厨今天一早派学徒送来了空冰篓，说是等着收你的去刺鱼柳。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 6>>三号防波堤的近海拖网船刚卸下深水大网银鳕，优先拨了两筐头水货到你的摊位上。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Fish">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Fish">>
<<if ($mpJobFishCatch or 0) gt 0>>
<br><br>上一趟的鱼获约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(($mpJobFishCatch or 0) / 100)>></span>，咸腥味还留在袖口。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobFishSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	鱼贩把你的竿收进了棚子。你被停了班，得先去鱼档把话说明白。
	<br>
	<<mpfishicon>><<link [[找老鱼贩说理 (0:03)|MP Job Punishment Fish 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobFish)>>
	<<swimicon>><<link [[去礁石下竿 (1:00)|MP Job Fish Shift]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看竿具潮位 (0:03)|MP Job Fish Upgrade]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
鱼档已经收摊了，栈桥边只亮着一盏防雾风灯。你决定等早潮再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Fish Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobFishSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Fish">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">><<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>><</if>>
<<set $mpJobFishExp to ($mpJobFishExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobFishLevel to ($mpJobFishExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFishExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFishExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFishExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFishExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobFishLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobFishPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobFishRod to 1>><</if>>
<<set _lv to ($mpJobFishLevel or 0)>><<set _night to (_lv gte 3 and Time.dayState is "night")>>
<<set _supplyBonus to ((($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 100 : 0) + (($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) gte 6 ? 120 : 0) + (($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 6 ? 120 : 0))>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海礁鱼摊 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobFish>>
	鱼档今日的渔获已经分拣收秤，鱼篓冲洗得干干净净。
<<else>>
	海风把鱼线吹出一道弧。礁石背阴处的水洼里，几条小鱼被浪推得打转。鱼贩的秤在身后吱呀作响。
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 4>><<link [[近岸撒网 (1:00)|MP Job Fish Settle]]>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<mpalert 6>><</if>><<set _skill to ($athletics or 0)>><<set _need to (280 + ((window.Weather and Weather.isOvercast) ? 40 : 0))>><<set _ok to (_skill gte _need or _lv gte 4 or random(170, _need) lte (_skill + _lv * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobFishExp to ($mpJobFishExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobFishLevel to ($mpJobFishExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFishExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFishExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFishExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFishExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (300 + ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) * 60 + Math.floor(_skill / 6) - ((window.Weather && Weather.precipitation isnot "none") ? 50 : 0)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobFishCatch to _pay>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "网兜出水时沉了一下。银鳞在碎冰上弹了两下，鱼贩过秤后把零钱拍在你掌心。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<athletics 2>><<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_fish_lv3")>><<money 3600>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "网脚被暗礁挂住，你拽了两次只拖上来一团海草。收回来的网破了半尺。鱼贩没让你赔，只让你自己补网。">><<set $mpJobFishCatch to 0>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFish to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<mpalertgain "撒网时水花四溅">><</if>>
	<<else>><<link [[近岸撒网 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "近岸撒网">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管外海舢板）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpclimbicon>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 4>><<link [[攀外礁下竿 (1:00)|MP Job Fish Settle]]>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<mpalert 6>><</if>><<set _skill to ($swimmingskill or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 260 or _lv gte 4 or random(160, 270) lte (_skill + _lv * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobFishExp to ($mpJobFishExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobFishLevel to ($mpJobFishExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFishExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFishExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFishExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFishExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (480 + ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) * 70 + Math.floor(_skill / 5)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobFishCatch to _pay>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你把竿梢压进浪里，线绷紧的那一刻手腕发麻。提上来的鱼背泛着淡青，鱼贩多看了两眼。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<swimmingskill 2>><<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_fish_lv3_keepsake")>><<money 3600>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "浪头比看上去高。你脚下一滑，膝盖磕在礁面上，钩子连着半截线被水卷走。鱼贩摆摆手，让你先回去换线。">><<set $mpJobFishCatch to 0>><<pain 2>><<stress 6>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFish to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<mpalertgain "攀礁时碎石滑落">><</if>>
	<<else>><<link [[攀外礁下竿 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "攀外礁下竿">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管外海舢板）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpherbicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 200 or _lv gte 2>><<link [[快刀片鳕 (1:00)|MP Job Fish Settle]]>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<mpalert 3>><</if>><<set _skill to ($tending or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 250 or _lv gte 3 or random(160, 260) lte (_skill + _lv * 35))>><<set $mpJobFishExp to ($mpJobFishExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobFishLevel to ($mpJobFishExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFishExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFishExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFishExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFishExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _tier to (_skill gte 320 or _lv gte 4 ? 3 : (_skill gte 260 or _lv gte 2 ? 2 : 1))>><<set _pay to 4 * (320 + _tier * 40 + ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) * 65 + Math.floor(_skill / 5)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobFishCatch to _pay>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你顺着鱼脊骨三刀片下晶莹透亮的去刺银鳕柳，腹肉与背柳按头等、二等分筐铺上盐冰，酒馆采买厨师布鲁诺当场按顶价收走。" : "你利落地剔净银鳕细刺，码进碎冰木筐，老鱼贩满意地过秤结账。")>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<tending 2>><<set $mpJobReg_Fish_1 to ($mpJobReg_Fish_1 or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "刀口偏了一分，划破了鱼胆，苦汁染了半案鱼柳，老鱼贩摇头让你先把案板冲干净。">><<set $mpJobFishCatch to 0>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFish to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[快刀片鳕 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "快刀片鳕">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<if _night>>
		<<link [[夜钓外海 (1:00)|MP Job Fish Settle]]>><<mpalert 4>><<set _pay to 4 * (620 + _lv * 80) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobFishCatch to _pay>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "灯罩把水面照出一小片黄。你把钩甩进暗处，等了很久，线才猛地一沉。提上来的鱼比白天都大。">><<set $mpJobFishExp to ($mpJobFishExp or 0) + 1>><<set $mpJobFishLevel to ($mpJobFishExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFishExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFishExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFishExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFishExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<tending 2>><<tiredness 4>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFish to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>><<mpalertgain "夜钓灯把水面照得发亮">>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[刮鳞分筐 (1:00)|MP Job Fish Settle]]>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<mpalert -5>><</if>><<set _pay to 4 * (240 + _lv * 45) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你蹲在冰筐边刮鳞，鱼皮在指下打滑。鱼贩把分好的筐搬上车，顺手多给了几枚铜板。">><<set $mpJobFishExp to ($mpJobFishExp or 0) + 1>><<set $mpJobFishLevel to ($mpJobFishExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFishExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFishExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFishExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFishExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFish to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<mpalertloss "蹲在角落安静刮鳞">><</if>>
		<span class="disabled">夜钓外海 (1:00)（需获配夜钓灯并等天黑）</span>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Fish Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Fish">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">><<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>><</if>>
<<set $mpJobFishExp to ($mpJobFishExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobFishLevel to ($mpJobFishExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFishExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFishExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFishExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFishExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobFishLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobFishPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobFishRod to 1>><</if>>
<<set _lv to ($mpJobFishLevel or 0)>><<set _night to (_lv gte 3 and Time.dayState is "night")>>
<<if $mpJobResultText>>
	<<print $mpJobResultText>>
	<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
		鱼贩把约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor($mpJobResultPay / 100)>></span> 的鱼钱拍在你掌心。
		<br><br>
		<<if !$mpJobResultMilestone and (($mpJobFishLevel or 0) lte ($mpJobFishLastLevel or 0))>><<if random(1, 3) is 1 and (Time.season is "spring" or Time.season is "summer")>><<if Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Fish Spring">><<else>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Fish Summer">><</if>><<else>><<set _rj to random(1, 3)>><<if _rj is 1>><<include "MP Job Random Fish">><<elseif _rj is 2>><<include "MP Job Random Fish 1">><<else>><<include "MP Job Random Fish 2">><</if>><</if>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobFishStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobFishStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobFishStrike - 1)>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gt ($mpJobFishLastLevel or 0)>>
			<br><br>
			<<if $mpJobFishLevel is 1>>鱼贩让你自己下近岸的网，不再跟在你身后看。<<elseif $mpJobFishLevel is 2>>你开始认得外礁的水色，旧竿换成了缠麻绳的加固竿。<<elseif $mpJobFishLevel is 3>>鱼贩把靠海风最顺的头等摊位留给你。<<elseif $mpJobFishLevel is 4>>你能借用栈桥边的轻便舢板去外海深水区下钩。<<else>>鱼贩把小艇铜钥匙扔给你，说整片海湾随你出船。<</if>>
			<<set $mpJobFishLastLevel to $mpJobFishLevel>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $mpJobResultMilestone>>
			<br><br>
			收竿时，鱼贩把一截缠好新线的加固竿梢和一封压秤赏钱递过来，什么也没多问。
			<<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobFishEncounter)>>
			栈桥另一头忽然传来一阵喧哗，港务巡检员正提着铜秤沿摊位走来。
			<br>
			<<investigateicon>><<link [[应对栈桥插曲 (0:05)|MP Job Fish Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[看竿具潮位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish Upgrade]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>>		<<getouticon>><<link [[返回鱼档摊位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobFishStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobFishStrike or 0) + 1)>><<if $mpJobFishStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobFishSuspended to 1>><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $mpJobFishStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Fish 1">><<elseif $mpJobFishStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Fish 2">><<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Fish 3">><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link "去鱼摊认罚 (0:03)">><<set _pun to "MP Job Punishment Fish " + ($mpJobFishStrike or 1)>><<pass 3>><<goto _pun>><</link>>
		<br>
				<<link [[返回鱼档摊位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<<else>>
	潮已经退到底了。你的桶空着，竿靠在棚子后面，鱼贩开始冲洗栈桥。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回码头 (0:10)|Docks]]>><<pass 10>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Fish Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">><<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>><</if>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFishEncounter to 1>>
港务巡检员提着黄铜弹簧秤停在鱼档前，目光扫过刚起网的碎冰木筐，伸手想要翻看底层的银鳕成色。老领航员哈克蹲在缆桩旁给你使了个眼色，老鱼贩正在棚后拴缆绳，一时腾不出手。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-fish-enc">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回鱼档 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 230 or ($science or 0) gte 230>><<link "掀开底冰验腮 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<if Time.dayState is "night">><<mpalert 3>><</if>><<replace "#mp-job-fish-enc">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你利落地拨开表层碎冰，挑出一条鳃丝鲜红透亮的银鳕托在掌心。巡检员对照刻度点了点头，当场在木筐角夹上一枚免检铅封。老鱼贩走回来满意地拍了拍筐沿，分给你一份头等品相赏钱。<span class="green">鱼档拿下了今日的头等鲜度签。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_fish_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 640>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Fish_3 to ($mpJobReg_Fish_3 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	冰水顺着袖口灌进手腕，你挑出的那条鱼恰好蹭掉了一块鳞片，巡检员皱眉记了一笔。<span class="red">你在冷风里忙出了一身冷汗。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回鱼档摊位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[掀开底冰验腮 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "掀开底冰验腮">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 6>><<link "出示渔船舱单 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-fish-enc">>
你取出三号防波堤拖网船刚签发的深水起网舱单与检疫铅印递给巡检员。巡检员认得独眼船长的印记，二话不说便盖了免检章，老鱼贩夸你上船跑过活就是好使。<span class="green">拖网船的直供舱单让鱼档免检过关。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_fish_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 760>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Fish_3 to ($mpJobReg_Fish_3 or 0) + 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回鱼档摊位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">出示渔船舱单 (0:05)（尚未熟稔拖网船舱单）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 210 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 210>><<link "递上烤鱼干搭话 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-fish-enc">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你顺手递过一包棚里刚烘好的椒盐小鱼干，三言两语同巡检员聊起早潮风向。对方笑着收起铜秤挥手放行，老鱼贩把省下的抽检损耗折成零钱塞进你兜里。<span class="green">你不动声色地应付了栈桥临检。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_fish_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 500>><</if>>
	<<skulduggery 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	巡检员摆手推开鱼干，公事公办地把每只木筐都翻检了一遍。<span class="red">重新码齐碎冰费了你不少工夫。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回鱼档摊位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[递上烤鱼干搭话 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "递上烤鱼干搭话">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link "低头安分添碎冰 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-fish-enc">>
你闷头把新铲的碎冰均匀铺在鱼篓表面，等巡检员例行查完走远，老鱼贩才走过来冲你点了点头。<span class="teal">临检平顺过去，没有出半点岔子。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_fish_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 280>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回鱼档摊位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Fish Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">><<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>><</if>>
<<set $mpJobFishExp to ($mpJobFishExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobFishLevel to ($mpJobFishExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFishExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFishExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFishExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFishExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
鱼贩把竿架翻过来，露出背面用粉笔写的潮位表。你蹲在缆桩旁，看他把断线一圈圈绕回线轴上。
<br><br>
<<if $mpJobFishLevel is 0>>
	你还在学看潮位。鱼贩让你先认缆桩上的水痕，别急着下网。
<<elseif $mpJobFishLevel is 1>>
	你已经能自己下近岸的网。鱼贩肯赊你一份好饵。
<<elseif $mpJobFishLevel is 2>>
	你开始认得外礁的水色。旧竿换了加固竿，夜钓灯也充上了电。
<<elseif $mpJobFishLevel is 3>>
	靠海风最顺的头等鱼摊如今归你打理。收网时，他会先问你的意见。
<<elseif $mpJobFishLevel is 4>>
	栈桥边的轻便舢板随时向你敞开，能撑去外海深水区下钩。鱼贩叮嘱风浪大时别逞强。
<<else>>
	潮位表上的暗记你已烂熟于心。鱼贩把小艇铜钥匙抛进你怀里，让你随时出海。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobFishRod or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobFishPenalty or 0) is 0>>加固竿靠在棚子最里面，握把上缠着新麻绳。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobFishCatch or 0) gt 0>>今天最后一趟的鱼获约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(($mpJobFishCatch or 0) / 100)>></span>。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Fish">>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回礁石 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<link [[看鱼摊当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Fish Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobFishExp or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryFish or 0) lt 3>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[探测暗礁道 (0:06)|MP Job Story Fish 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Job Spa [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 22)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开桑拿浴场 (0:02)|Spa]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobSpaExp to ($mpJobSpaExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobSpaLevel to ($mpJobSpaExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
温泉的潮气在更衣室门口凝成一层白雾。<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把叠好的热毛巾放进藤篮，抬眼看你，声音压得很低：「今天池边人多，手脚要稳。」
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobSpa>>
你换下的制服搭在长凳上，袖口还是潮的。<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>冲你摇摇头，示意今天的班已经排满了。
<<elseif ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 3>>
私汤木牌翻到了「使用中」，<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把铜钥匙推给你，让你替老客人看着水温。
<<else>>
池边的铜灯刚点上，水面浮着一层薄雾。<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把班表折好塞进围裙口袋。
<</if>>
<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobSpa)>>
	<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Spa Winter">><<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Spa Rain">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "winter">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Spa Winter">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Spa Festival">>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	更衣室的地上全是湿脚印，毛巾换得比平时快。
<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>
	最后一池水放平后，整间浴场只剩铜灯的轻响。
<</if>>
<<if ($exposed or 0) gte 1>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>递来一条宽毛巾，示意你先围好再进池边。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 2>>
	孤儿院浆洗房送来的毛巾叠得方正挺括，带着淡淡的皂角清香，客人们取用时赞不绝口。
	<<stress -1>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2>>
	河湾农场晒干的新鲜迷迭香挂在蒸汽房铜网下，水雾里满是舒缓的草木香气。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobTailorCount or 0) gte 6>>高街裁缝铺替私汤贵宾改制的真丝浴袍叠在更衣柜顶层，针脚严密服帖。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Spa">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Spa">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobSpaSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把班表收了起来。你被停了班，得先去前台把话说明白。
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[找乔丹说理 (0:03)|MP Job Punishment Spa 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobSpa)>>
	<<mpswimicon>><<link [[进池边当班 (1:00)|MP Job Spa Shift]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看排班 (0:03)|MP Job Spa Upgrade]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
桑拿房已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Spa Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobSpaSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Spa">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobSpaExp to ($mpJobSpaExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobSpaLevel to ($mpJobSpaExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobSpaLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobSpaPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobSpaPrivate to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobSpaLevel gte 4 and ($mpJobSpaPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobSpaRegular to 1>><</if>>
<<set _supplyBonus to ((($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 120 : 0) + (($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 100 : 0))>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回桑拿前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobSpa>>
	温泉桑拿房今日的值班已经结束，木桶与毛巾皆已归位。
<<else>>
	热水沿石槽淌下去，蒸汽把铜灯的光晕开。有人靠在池边闭目，湿发贴在颈侧。你端着毛巾从雾里穿过去。
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 3>><<link [[替客人擦背 (1:00)|MP Job Spa Settle]]>><<set _skill to ($tending or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 280 or ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 3 or random(170, 290) lte (_skill + ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobSpaExp to ($mpJobSpaExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobSpaLevel to ($mpJobSpaExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (700 + ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) * 100 + Math.floor(_skill / 4) + (($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 4 ? 100 : 0)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你把热毛巾搭上客人肩背，力道从肩胛往下压。对方长长吐了口气，临走前往藤篮里压了一张纸币。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<tending 2>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<if ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_spa_lv3")>><<money 6000>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "毛巾的水没拧干，顺着客人后背淌进腰际。对方皱着眉叫来" + ((mpNpcMet("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "，" + ((mpNpcMet("Jordan")) ? "乔丹" : "神殿修士") + "让你先去后面缓一缓，这班没有工钱。">><<stress 8>><<tiredness 3>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobSpa to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[替客人擦背 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "替客人擦背">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管私汤铜钥）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if ($beauty or 0) gte 2200 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 3>><<link [[池边引位调温 (1:00)|MP Job Spa Settle]]>><<set _skill to Math.max(Math.floor(($beauty or 0) / 10), ($seductionskill or 0))>><<set _ok to (($beauty or 0) gte 3000 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 280 or ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 3 or random(170, 290) lte (_skill + ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobSpaExp to ($mpJobSpaExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobSpaLevel to ($mpJobSpaExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (620 + ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) * 90 + Math.floor(_skill / 4) + (($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 4 ? 100 : 0)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你引着客人绕过湿滑的石阶，顺手把水温调低半格。有人把毛巾搭在你腕上，指尖多停了一瞬，随后留下一笔不小的小费。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 2>><<stress 3>><<if ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_spa_lv3_keepsake")>><<money 6000>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你指错了更衣间的方向，客人裹着浴巾在雾里站了半天。投诉传到前台，这班没有小费，前台让你先去看水。">><<stress 8>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobSpa to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[池边引位调温 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "池边引位调温">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "美貌：3000 或 魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管私汤铜钥）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpherbicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 200 or ($science or 0) gte 200 or ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link [[私汤调香 (1:00)|MP Job Spa Settle]]>><<set _skill to Math.max(($housekeeping or 0), ($science or 0))>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 260 or ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 3 or random(160, 270) lte (_skill + ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) * 35))>><<set $mpJobSpaExp to ($mpJobSpaExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobSpaLevel to ($mpJobSpaExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _tier to (_skill gte 320 or ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 4 ? 3 : 2)>><<set _pay to 4 * (640 + _tier * 40 + ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) * 95 + Math.floor(_skill / 4)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你按私汤贵客的偏好，将农场干迷迭香、甘菊露与甜橙精油分三档浸入石槽，水雾温润醇厚，塞西莉亚与维奥拉夫人都留下了丰厚赏金。" : "你调匀香薰炉与出水口药包，私汤隔间香气宜人，客人满意而归。")>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 2>><<stress 2>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_1 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_1 or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "药包扎口没系紧，草叶散进汤池里，前台让你先把池水放干重刷，这班没有工钱。">><<stress 6>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobSpa to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[私汤调香 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "私汤调香">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[清理蒸汽房 (1:00)|MP Job Spa Settle]]>><<set _pay to 4 * (420 + ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) * 60) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你掀开排水口的铜盖，把缠在滤网上的头发一点点扯出来。蒸汽熏得眼睛发酸，但没人再来挑毛病。">><<set $mpJobSpaExp to ($mpJobSpaExp or 0) + 1>><<set $mpJobSpaLevel to ($mpJobSpaExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 1>><<tiredness 4>><<stress 2>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobSpa to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Spa Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Spa">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobSpaExp to ($mpJobSpaExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobSpaLevel to ($mpJobSpaExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobSpaLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobSpaPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobSpaPrivate to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobSpaLevel gte 4 and ($mpJobSpaPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobSpaRegular to 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpJobResultText>>
	<<print $mpJobResultText>>
	<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
		前台把约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor($mpJobResultPay / 100)>></span> 塞进你的工钱袋。
		<br><br>
		<<if !$mpJobResultMilestone and (($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) lte ($mpJobSpaLastLevel or 0))>><<if random(1, 3) is 1 and (Time.season is "spring" or Time.season is "summer")>><<if Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Spa Spring">><<else>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Spa Summer">><</if>><<else>><<set _rj to random(1, 3)>><<if _rj is 1>><<include "MP Job Random Spa">><<elseif _rj is 2>><<include "MP Job Random Spa 1">><<else>><<include "MP Job Random Spa 2">><</if>><</if>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobSpaStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobSpaStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobSpaStrike - 1)>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gt ($mpJobSpaLastLevel or 0)>>
			<br><br>
			<<if $mpJobSpaLevel is 1>>你递巾的动作稳了，有客人开始在你经过时抬头。<<elseif $mpJobSpaLevel is 2>>有人点你的手法，私汤的木牌挂到了门边。<<elseif $mpJobSpaLevel is 3>>固定客人会问你哪天当班。<<elseif $mpJobSpaLevel is 4>>你能自己开关池子。<<else>><<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>说这间浴场交给你很放心。<</if>>
			<<set $mpJobSpaLastLevel to $mpJobSpaLevel>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $mpJobResultMilestone>>
			<br><br>
			<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把私汤的木牌和一小串铜钥匙一起放进你掌心，说以后这间归你照看。
			<<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobSpaEncounter)>>
			私汤回廊的传呼铜铃忽然连响了两声，二号汤池的贵客正隔着竹帘唤人。
			<br>
			<<mpcookicon>><<link [[应门照料汤客 (0:05)|MP Job Spa Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[查看排班表 (0:02)|MP Job Spa Upgrade]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>>		<<getouticon>><<link [[返回池边前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobSpaStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobSpaStrike or 0) + 1)>><<if $mpJobSpaStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobSpaSuspended to 1>><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $mpJobSpaStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Spa 1">><<elseif $mpJobSpaStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Spa 2">><<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Spa 3">><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link "去浴场认罚 (0:03)">><<set _pun to "MP Job Punishment Spa " + ($mpJobSpaStrike or 1)>><<pass 3>><<goto _pun>><</link>>
		<br>
				<<link [[返回池边前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<<else>>
	池边的水已经放平了。你的制服叠在长凳上，蒸汽也散得差不多了。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回桑拿 (0:08)|Spa]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Spa Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobSpaEncounter to 1>>
一号私汤隔间里水雾氤氲，常客老议员夫人维奥拉正披着丝绸浴袍蹙眉看着木盘里的粗粒海盐，抱怨盐粒太硬磨得肩头生疼，要当班侍应立刻重新调配。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-spa-enc">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回池边 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 230 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 230>><<link "兑温牛乳化盐 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-spa-enc">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你取来温热的牛乳与甘菊露徐徐兑入盐盅，用玉杵细细研成柔滑膏状再敷上客人的肩头。维奥拉夫人舒爽地长舒一口气，在竹托盘上多压了一枚半克朗银币。<span class="green">你调出的乳浴膏赢得了贵客夸赞。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_spa_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 660>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_2 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_2 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	牛乳兑得太急溅湿了托盘布，你连忙跪在石阶边换布擦拭，额角沁出细汗。<span class="red">闷热蒸汽让你有些气短。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回池边前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[兑温牛乳化盐 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "兑温牛乳化盐">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfarmicon>><<if ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "取农场甘菊粉 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-spa-enc">>
你取出河湾农场温室特供的超细甘菊花粉混入温蜂蜜中，替代了磨肤的粗海盐。细腻温润的草木花膏敷上肩头，维奥拉夫人惊喜不已，当场赏了你一笔厚金。<span class="green">农场直供的甘菊花粉深得贵客欢心。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_spa_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 740>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_2 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_2 or 0) + 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回池边前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">取农场甘菊粉 (0:05)（农场还没这份交情）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfirstaidicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 210 or ($english or 0) gte 210>><<link "点甜橙香安抚 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-spa-enc">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你先点亮桌角的甜橙香薰炉，轻声细语地解释矿盐活血的妙处，又替对方换上细绒热敷巾。维奥拉夫人脸色转霁，临走时往你袖袋里塞了份体己小费。<span class="green">你得体的应对令私汤重归静谧。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_spa_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 520>><</if>>
	<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Spa_2 to ($mpJobReg_Spa_2 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	夫人并不买账，挥手让你把粗盐撤走，只留下一室沉闷水汽。<span class="red">你赔着笑退出了竹帘。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回池边前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[点甜橙香安抚 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "点甜橙香安抚">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link "换上烘暖浴巾 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-spa-enc">>
你一声不响地撤下粗盐盅，换上刚从暖石板上烘热的松软浴巾。维奥拉夫人没再挑剔，闭上眼重新靠回池壁。<span class="teal">你稳妥地安顿好了私汤客人。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_spa_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 290>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回池边前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Spa Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobSpaExp to ($mpJobSpaExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobSpaLevel to ($mpJobSpaExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobSpaExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把排班表铺在干燥的长凳上，纸角用两只铜夹压住。表上除了名字，还标着每间池子的水温和客人的习惯。
<br><br>
<<if $mpJobSpaLevel is 0>>
	你还在记池边毛巾和铜灯的位置。<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>让你先看水，别急着接客人。
<<elseif $mpJobSpaLevel is 1>>
	你递巾的动作稳了。有客人开始在你经过时抬头。
<<elseif $mpJobSpaLevel is 2>>
	有人点你的手法。私汤的木牌挂到了门边，背面刻着你的名字缩写。
<<elseif $mpJobSpaLevel is 3>>
	相熟的常客进门总会先打听你的排班。<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把私汤的钥匙交给你。
<<elseif $mpJobSpaLevel is 4>>
	你能自己开关池子。打烊后，水汽散尽，整间浴场都听你的。
<<else>>
	排班表上的名字你能背下来。<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>说这间交给你很放心。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobSpaPrivate or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobSpaPenalty or 0) is 0>>私汤的木牌挂在门边，背面刻着你的名字缩写。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobSpaRegular or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobSpaPenalty or 0) is 0>>有几位客人只在你在班时才来，点名要你看水温。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Spa">>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回池边 (0:02)|MP Job Spa]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[看汤池当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Spa Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobSpaExp or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStorySpa or 0) lt 3>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[清疏古泉眼 (0:06)|MP Job Story Spa 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Job Farm [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 20)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开河湾农田 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobFarmExp to ($mpJobFarmExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobFarmLevel to ($mpJobFarmExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
谷仓门半开着，干草和湿土的气味一起涌出来。<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把铁锹插进田埂，拍了拍手上的泥，指了指靠河那排空畦。
<br><br>
<<set _today to Math.max(1, ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set _planted to ($mpJobFarmPlantedDay or 0)>>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobFarm>>
你的靴子还沾着泥，草料叉靠在仓门边。<<elseif _planted is 0>>
靠河的畦还空着，土面被昨夜的潮气压得发亮。<<elseif _today gt _planted>>
苗已经长到小腿高，穗子被风压得齐齐偏向河边。<<else>>
苗刚种下，表土发白。<</if>>
<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobFarm)>>
	<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Farm Winter">><<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Farm Rain">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "winter">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Farm Winter">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Farm Festival">>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	田埂被雨泡软，踩下去会陷半寸。
<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>提着灯从谷仓那头走来，灯影在垄沟里拉得很长。
<</if>>
<<if ($tiredness or 0) gte 800>>
	你扶着锹把歇了一会儿，<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>没催。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>说海风咖啡馆订了你的头茬麦粉，收成不愁卖。
	<<stress -1>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 6>>
	丰收街石炉面包房的马车每周都来拉麦袋，给田庄添了一份固定进项。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobStableCount or 0) gte 6>>河湾马厩的挽马一早便把熟腐的苜蓿肥拉到了田头，顺带替谷仓捎走进城的麦袋。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 2>>多瑙河街温泉桑拿房长期包销温室晒干的迷迭香与甘菊。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Farm">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Farm">>
<<if ($mpJobFarmGreenhouse or 0) is 1>>
<br><br>温室的门虚掩着，里面比外头暖，玻璃上凝着一层水雾。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobFarmSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把铁锹插回田埂，没让你下地。
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[找农场主说理 (0:03)|MP Job Punishment Farm 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobFarm)>>
	<<runicon>><<link [[下地干活 (1:00)|MP Job Farm Shift]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[看农活账 (0:03)|MP Job Farm Upgrade]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
农场已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Farm Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobFarmSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Farm">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobFarmExp to ($mpJobFarmExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobFarmLevel to ($mpJobFarmExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobFarmLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobFarmPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobFarmGreenhouse to 1>><</if>>
<<set _today to Math.max(1, ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set _planted to ($mpJobFarmPlantedDay or 0)>><<set _ready to (_planted gt 0 and _today gt _planted)>><<set _rain to (window.Weather && Weather.precipitation isnot "none")>>
<<set _supplyBonus to ((($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 100 : 0) + (($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 6 ? 120 : 0) + (($mpJobStableCount or 0) gte 6 ? 100 : 0))>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回河湾田埂 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobFarm>>
	农场田垄今日的农活已经忙完，农具整齐挂回了棚屋。
<<else>>
	<<if _planted is 0>>
		泥地昨夜受了潮，踩下去会陷半寸。种子袋口敞着，风一吹，几粒黑麦种滚到田埂边。
	<<elseif _ready>>
		穗子沉得压弯了秆。<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把镰刀磨石往你脚边一放，示意你从最靠河的那一垄开始。
	<<else>>
		你昨天翻过的畦面冒出一层细芽。表土发白，指头按下去是干的，得赶在日头偏西前浇一遍。
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if _planted is 0>>
		<<mpfarmicon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 6000 or ($tending or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 4>><<link [[挥锄培土播种 (1:00)|MP Job Farm Settle]]>><<set _skill to Math.max(Math.floor(($physique or 0) / 30), ($tending or 0))>><<set _ok to (($physique or 0) gte 8000 or ($tending or 0) gte 280 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 4 or random(170, 290) lte (_skill + ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobFarmExp to ($mpJobFarmExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobFarmLevel to ($mpJobFarmExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (220 + ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) * 40) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobFarmPlantedDay to _today>><<set $mpJobFarmGrowth to 0>><<set $mpJobFarmPlots to (1 + (($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 4 ? 2 : (($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 1 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你把种子按进湿土，覆上一层细土，再用脚背轻轻压实。" + ((mpNpcMet("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "在田埂上看了一会儿，没挑出毛病。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<tending 2>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 4>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "垄沟开歪了，种子撒得太密。" + ((mpNpcMet("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "让你返工，日头落下去时只播完半畦。">><<stress 6>><<tiredness 5>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFarm to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
		<<else>><<link [[挥锄培土播种 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "挥锄培土播种">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：8000 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已熟稔三畦轮作）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<<elseif _ready>>
		<<runicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 4>><<link [[开镰收割 (1:00)|MP Job Farm Settle]]>><<set _skill to ($athletics or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 300 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 4 or random(170, 300) lte (_skill + ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobFarmExp to ($mpJobFarmExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobFarmLevel to ($mpJobFarmExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _plots to ($mpJobFarmPlots or 1)>><<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (_plots * (300 + ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) * 70) + Math.floor(_skill / 5) - (_rain ? 80 : 0)) + _supplyBonus)>><<set $mpJobFarmPlantedDay to 0>><<set $mpJobFarmGrowth to 0>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "镰刀贴着地皮走，穗子一束束倒进臂弯。你和" + ((mpNpcMet("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "把收成码上板车，麦芒扎得小臂发痒。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<athletics 2>><<tiredness 5>><<stress 2>><<if ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_farm_lv3")>><<money 5400>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "镰刀吃进湿泥，你用力一扯，连根带土翻起半垄。" + ((mpNpcMet("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "蹲下去看了看被踩倒的苗，摇了摇头，这一季算白种了。">><<set $mpJobFarmPlantedDay to 0>><<set $mpJobFarmGrowth to 0>><<stress 8>><<tiredness 4>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFarm to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
		<<else>><<link [[开镰收割 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "开镰收割">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>（或已熟稔三畦轮作）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<gardenicon "water">><<if (window.Weather && Weather.precipitation isnot "none") or ($physique or 0) gte 6000 or ($tending or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 4>><<link [[浇水培土 (1:00)|MP Job Farm Settle]]>><<set _skill to Math.max(Math.floor(($physique or 0) / 30), ($tending or 0))>><<set _ok to (_rain or ($physique or 0) gte 8000 or ($tending or 0) gte 280 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 4 or random(170, 290) lte (_skill + ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) * 35))>><<set $mpJobFarmExp to ($mpJobFarmExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobFarmLevel to ($mpJobFarmExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (200 + ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) * 35) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobFarmGrowth to (($mpJobFarmGrowth or 0) + 1)>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你拎着木桶沿垄沟走，水渗进土里，细芽慢慢挺直。" + ((mpNpcMet("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "用脚尖拨了拨湿土，说这畦稳了。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<tending 2>><<tiredness 3>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "水浇得太急，冲出一道浅沟，几株嫩芽被冲得歪倒。" + ((mpNpcMet("Alex")) ? "亚历克斯" : "年轻农夫") + "让你重新培土。">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFarm to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
		<<else>><<link [[浇水培土 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "浇水培土">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "雨雪天气 或 体魄：8000 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已熟稔三畦轮作）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 200 or ($science or 0) gte 200 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link [[温室育苗 (1:00)|MP Job Farm Settle]]>><<set _skill to Math.max(($tending or 0), ($science or 0))>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 260 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 3 or random(160, 270) lte (_skill + ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) * 35))>><<set $mpJobFarmExp to ($mpJobFarmExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobFarmLevel to ($mpJobFarmExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _tier to (_skill gte 320 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 4 ? 3 : 2)>><<set _pay to 4 * (290 + _tier * 35 + ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) * 60 + Math.floor(_skill / 5)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你按头等香草苗与耐寒麦种分盘控温育苗，叶片翠绿挺拔，草药商玛莎与磨坊主霍利斯当场加付了育苗定金。" : "你替温室育苗盘松土喷水，嫩苗长势整齐，亚历克斯满意地点了点头。")>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<tending 2>><<tiredness 2>><<set $mpJobReg_Farm_2 to ($mpJobReg_Farm_2 or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "通风窗开得太大，冷风吹蔫了外沿两盘嫩苗，亚历克斯让你先把苗盘挪回内侧，这班没算工钱。">><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFarm to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[温室育苗 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "温室育苗">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[搬料补篱笆 (1:00)|MP Job Farm Settle]]>><<set _pay to 4 * (280 + ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) * 50) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你把草捆拖进棚里，又用铁丝把松动的篱笆桩重新绑紧。手上的泥干了，搓一搓就往下掉。">><<set $mpJobFarmExp to ($mpJobFarmExp or 0) + 1>><<set $mpJobFarmLevel to ($mpJobFarmExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<physique 1>><<tiredness 3>><<stress 1>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFarm to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Farm Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Farm">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobFarmExp to ($mpJobFarmExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobFarmLevel to ($mpJobFarmExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobFarmLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobFarmPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobFarmGreenhouse to 1>><</if>>
<<set _today to Math.max(1, ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set _planted to ($mpJobFarmPlantedDay or 0)>><<set _ready to (_planted gt 0 and _today gt _planted)>><<set _rain to (window.Weather && Weather.precipitation isnot "none")>>
<<if $mpJobResultText>>
	<<print $mpJobResultText>>
	<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
		<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor($mpJobResultPay / 100)>></span> 的工钱数给你。
		<br><br>
		<<if !$mpJobResultMilestone and (($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) lte ($mpJobFarmLastLevel or 0))>><<if random(1, 3) is 1 and (Time.season is "spring" or Time.season is "summer")>><<if Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Farm Spring">><<else>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Farm Summer">><</if>><<else>><<set _rj to random(1, 3)>><<if _rj is 1>><<include "MP Job Random Farm">><<elseif _rj is 2>><<include "MP Job Random Farm 1">><<else>><<include "MP Job Random Farm 2">><</if>><</if>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobFarmStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobFarmStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobFarmStrike - 1)>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gt ($mpJobFarmLastLevel or 0)>>
			<br><br>
			<<if $mpJobFarmLevel is 1>>你能同时照料两畦，<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>不再跟在后面返工。<<elseif $mpJobFarmLevel is 2>>你拿到温室钥匙，雨天也能育苗。<<elseif $mpJobFarmLevel is 3>>排水沟修好以后，涝天也不减产。<<elseif $mpJobFarmLevel is 4>>三畦轮作已经跑顺。<<else>><<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把下一季的种子单交给你。<</if>>
			<<set $mpJobFarmLastLevel to $mpJobFarmLevel>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $mpJobResultMilestone>>
			<br><br>
			<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把温室钥匙挂到钉子上，又取下来放进你手里，说以后育苗不用等天。
			<<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobFarmEncounter)>>
			谷仓外的田埂上忽然有人高声招呼，似是交接农货时出了状况。
			<br>
			<<mpfarmicon>><<link [[田埂有人招呼 (0:05)|MP Job Farm Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[看农活账 (0:02)|MP Job Farm Upgrade]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>>		<<getouticon>><<link [[返回田埂 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobFarmStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobFarmStrike or 0) + 1)>><<if $mpJobFarmStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobFarmSuspended to 1>><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $mpJobFarmStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Farm 1">><<elseif $mpJobFarmStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Farm 2">><<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Farm 3">><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link "去谷仓认罚 (0:03)">><<set _pun to "MP Job Punishment Farm " + ($mpJobFarmStrike or 1)>><<pass 3>><<goto _pun>><</link>>
		<br>
				<<link [[返回田埂 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<<else>>
	你把草料叉靠回仓门，靴底的泥在石阶上刮出两道印。今天的活已经结束了。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回农场 (0:12)|Farmland]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Farm Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobFarmExp to ($mpJobFarmExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobFarmLevel to ($mpJobFarmExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobFarmExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把农活账摊在木箱上，用石头压住纸角。账页上记着畦数、播种日和每次浇水的日子。
<br><br>
<<if $mpJobFarmLevel is 0>>
	你还在学看墒情。<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>让你先浇一畦，别把苗冲倒。
<<elseif $mpJobFarmLevel is 1>>
	你能同时照料两畦。垄沟开得直了，<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>不再跟在后面返工。
<<elseif $mpJobFarmLevel is 2>>
	你拿到温室钥匙。雨天也能育苗，河湾那排空地终于不用等天。
<<elseif $mpJobFarmLevel is 3>>
	排水沟修好后涝天也不减产，<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>让你自己排畦。
<<elseif $mpJobFarmLevel is 4>>
	三畦轮作已经跑顺。<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把开春的选种清单交由你拍板。
<<else>>
	账上的畦数排满了。<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>说今年的地随你安排。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _today to Math.max(1, ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set _planted to ($mpJobFarmPlantedDay or 0)>>
<<if _planted is 0>>地里现在空着。
<<elseif _today gt _planted>>地里的作物已经熟透，可以收割了。
<<else>>苗还在长，要等明天再收。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobFarmPlantedDay or 0) gt 0>>｜你数了数，畦里共有 <<print ($mpJobFarmPlots or 1)>> 垄作物。<<if ($mpJobFarmGrowth or 0) gte 80>>穗子已经沉甸甸地压弯了秆。<<elseif ($mpJobFarmGrowth or 0) gte 40>>苗已经蹿高了一截。<<else>>新芽才刚破土。<</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Farm">>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回田埂 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfarmicon>><<link [[看田间当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Farm Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobFarmExp or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryFarm or 0) lt 3>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[规划三畦田 (0:06)|MP Job Story Farm 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Job Clock [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 21)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开钟表铺面 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobClockExp to ($mpJobClockExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobClockLevel to ($mpJobClockExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobClockExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobClockExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobClockExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobClockExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把一枚拆到一半的怀表推到你面前。镊子、油壶和放大镜在墨绿绒布上排成一列，窗外的电车线偶尔擦出一星蓝火。
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobClock>>
你手上的表油还没洗净，工作台的灯已经关了。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>正把工具一件件收回木盒。
<<elseif ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 3>>
柜台后头那块「承接委托」的木牌翻了过来。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把一张写着客人姓名的纸条压在放大镜下。
<<else>>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>用镊子敲了敲桌面：「先听摆轮，再动螺丝。拆坏了就从废料盒里自己找零件补上。」
<</if>>
<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobClock)>>
	<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Clock Winter">><<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Clock Rain">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "winter">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Clock Winter">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Clock Festival">>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	铺子里潮气重，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>让你先把表壳擦干再上手。
<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>
	街上没什么人，挂钟的滴答声显得格外清楚。
<</if>>
<<if ($tiredness or 0) gte 800>>
	你捏镊子的手有点抖，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把灯往你这边挪了挪。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 6>>
	街巷跑腿行替铺子送来了从外埠加急调运的瑞士游丝，省去了不少等待工夫。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 6>>旧港拖网船与河湾车队定期将防潮罗盘和货运怀表送来铺子检修。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Clock">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Clock">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobClockSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把工作台的灯关了。你被停了班，得先去柜台把话说明白。
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[找修表师说理 (0:03)|MP Job Punishment Clock 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobClock)>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[坐下开工 (1:00)|MP Job Clock Shift]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[翻看委托簿 (0:03)|MP Job Clock Upgrade]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
钟表铺已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Clock Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobClockSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Clock">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobClockExp to ($mpJobClockExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobClockLevel to ($mpJobClockExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobClockExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobClockExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobClockExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobClockExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobClockLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobClockPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobClockCommission to 1>><</if>> <<if $mpJobClockLevel gte 4 and ($mpJobClockPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobClockHighEnd to 1>><</if>> <<if $mpJobClockLevel gte 5 and ($mpJobClockPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobClockPartner to 1>><</if>>
<<set _supplyBonus to (($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 6 ? 140 : 0)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回修表柜台 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobClock>>
	钟表铺工作台今日的学徒活计已经收工，零件盒全部锁妥。
<<else>>
	齿轮在镊子尖上咬合，发出极轻的一声。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>在柜台那头修一把银壳怀表，头也不抬地说：「先听摆轮，再动螺丝。」
	<br><br>
	<<mpclockworkicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 4>><<link [[拆洗表芯 (1:00)|MP Job Clock Settle]]>><<set _skill to ($maths or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 280 or ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 4 or random(170, 290) lte (_skill + ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobClockExp to ($mpJobClockExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobClockLevel to ($mpJobClockExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobClockExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobClockExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobClockExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobClockExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (650 + ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) * 110 + Math.floor(_skill / 5)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你把摆轮重新校平，秒针走出一圈均匀的轻响。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "凑近听了一会儿，把工钱推过来，没说什么。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<mathsskill 1 "no_star">><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<if ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_clock_lv3_1")>><<money 1200>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "游丝被你捏变了形，装回去后表针走走停停。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "拆下报废的零件，把那枚坏零件丢进废料盒，让你先歇手。">><<stress 5>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobClock to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[拆洗表芯 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拆洗表芯">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已在铺面铜牌留名）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mprepairicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 4>><<link [[校准齿轮 (1:00)|MP Job Clock Settle]]>><<set _skill to ($science or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 300 or ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 4 or random(170, 300) lte (_skill + ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobClockExp to ($mpJobClockExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobClockLevel to ($mpJobClockExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobClockExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobClockExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobClockExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobClockExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (700 + ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) * 110 + Math.floor(_skill / 5)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你把擒纵叉的角度调了半格，齿轮咬合声立刻变得干净。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "把表壳合上，在账本里记了一笔。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<scienceskill 1 "no_star">><<if ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_clock_lv3_2")>><<money 1200>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "齿轮装反了一面，你硬压下去时崩掉一个齿。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "用镊子夹起碎片看了很久。">><<stress 5>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobClock to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[校准齿轮 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "校准齿轮">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>（或已在铺面铜牌留名）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 4>><<link [[拆壳取零件 (1:00)|MP Job Clock Settle]]>><<set _skill to ($skulduggery or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 320 or ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 4 or random(170, 320) lte (_skill + ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobClockExp to ($mpJobClockExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobClockLevel to ($mpJobClockExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobClockExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobClockExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobClockExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobClockExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (820 + ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) * 110 + Math.floor(_skill / 5)) + _supplyBonus)>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你用薄刃挑开旧壳的卡扣，里头的摆轮和宝石轴承都还完好。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "扫了一眼，按零件价给你记了工钱。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<skulduggery 2>><<if ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_clock_lv3_3")>><<money 1200>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "刀尖打滑，在夹板上划出一道深痕，还崩了指尖。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "把那块壳子丢进废料盒，把盒子推远，没让你赔。">><<pain 3>><<stress 6>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobClock to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[拆壳取零件 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拆壳取零件">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>（或已在铺面铜牌留名）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[擦拭展柜摆钟 (1:00)|MP Job Clock Settle]]>><<set _pay to 4 * (360 + ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) * 60) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你用麂皮布把玻璃展柜和三座落地摆钟的黄铜钟摆擦得纤尘不染，又按整点对准了音簧。" + (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "修表师") + "扫了一眼锃亮的柜面，给你记下学徒工钱。">><<set $mpJobClockExp to ($mpJobClockExp or 0) + 1>><<set $mpJobClockLevel to ($mpJobClockExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobClockExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobClockExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobClockExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobClockExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobClock to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Clock Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Clock">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobClockExp to ($mpJobClockExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobClockLevel to ($mpJobClockExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobClockExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobClockExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobClockExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobClockExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobClockLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobClockPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobClockCommission to 1>><</if>> <<if $mpJobClockLevel gte 4 and ($mpJobClockPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobClockHighEnd to 1>><</if>> <<if $mpJobClockLevel gte 5 and ($mpJobClockPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobClockPartner to 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpJobResultText>>
	<<print $mpJobResultText>>
	<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
		<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor($mpJobResultPay / 100)>></span> 推到你手边。
		<br><br>
		<<if !$mpJobResultMilestone and (($mpJobClockLevel or 0) lte ($mpJobClockLastLevel or 0))>><<if random(1, 3) is 1 and (Time.season is "spring" or Time.season is "summer")>><<if Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Clock Spring">><<else>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Clock Summer">><</if>><<else>><<set _rj to random(1, 3)>><<if _rj is 1>><<include "MP Job Random Clock">><<elseif _rj is 2>><<include "MP Job Random Clock 1">><<else>><<include "MP Job Random Clock 2">><</if>><</if>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobClockStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobClockStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobClockStrike - 1)>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gt ($mpJobClockLastLevel or 0)>>
			<br><br>
			<<if $mpJobClockLevel is 1>>你能独立换摆轮，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把简单委托推到你手边。<<elseif $mpJobClockLevel is 2>>你开始接高价维修，柜台里那只银壳三问表只让你碰。<<elseif $mpJobClockLevel is 3>>委托栏上挂了一块刻你名字的小铜牌。<<elseif $mpJobClockLevel is 4>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>让你在招牌上署名。<<else>>委托簿上一半的活已经写着你的名字。<</if>>
			<<set $mpJobClockLastLevel to $mpJobClockLevel>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $mpJobResultMilestone>>
			<br><br>
			<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把一块刻着你名字的小铜牌挂到委托栏上，说以后高价维修也归你接。
			<<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobClockEncounter)>>
			铺面玻璃门上的铜铃叮当一响，一位熟客捧着表盒急匆匆走近柜台。
			<br>
			<<investigateicon>><<link [[柜台送来急件 (0:05)|MP Job Clock Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[翻看委托簿 (0:02)|MP Job Clock Upgrade]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>>		<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工作台 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobClockStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobClockStrike or 0) + 1)>><<if $mpJobClockStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobClockSuspended to 1>><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $mpJobClockStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Clock 1">><<elseif $mpJobClockStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Clock 2">><<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Clock 3">><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link "去柜台认罚 (0:03)">><<set _pun to "MP Job Punishment Clock " + ($mpJobClockStrike or 1)>><<pass 3>><<goto _pun>><</link>>
		<br>
				<<link [[返回工作台 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<<else>>
	工作台的灯已经熄了。你的镊子放回绒布槽里，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>正在锁抽屉。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Clock Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobClockExp to ($mpJobClockExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobClockLevel to ($mpJobClockExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobClockExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobClockExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobClockExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobClockExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
委托簿摊在柜台上，纸页间夹着几张画了机芯草图的便签。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把放大镜推到一边，让你自己翻。
<br><br>
<<if $mpJobClockLevel is 0>>
	你还在认零件。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>让你先拆旧壳，别碰客人的表。
<<elseif $mpJobClockLevel is 1>>
	你能独立换摆轮。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把简单委托推到你手边。
<<elseif $mpJobClockLevel is 2>>
	你开始接高价维修。柜台里那只银壳三问表，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>只让你碰。
<<elseif $mpJobClockLevel is 3>>
	名表和复杂机芯的活写着你的名字。委托栏上挂了一块小铜牌。
<<elseif $mpJobClockLevel is 4>>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>准许你在修表回执与铺面铜牌上刻下自己的印记。
<<else>>
	柜台预约簿上过半的精修单都指名叫你接手。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>说招牌该重新漆了。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobClockCommission or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobClockPenalty or 0) is 0>>委托栏上挂着一块刻你名字的小铜牌。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobClockHighEnd or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobClockPenalty or 0) is 0>>绒布匣里最贵重的古董三问怀表，如今全都交由你亲手调校。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobClockPartner or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobClockPenalty or 0) is 0>>招牌右下角多了一行小字，是你的名字。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Clock">>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工作台 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看钟铺当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Clock Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobClockExp or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryClock or 0) lt 3>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[联校月台钟 (0:06)|MP Job Story Clock 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Job Laundry [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 22)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开浆洗房 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobLaundryExp to ($mpJobLaundryExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobLaundryLevel to ($mpJobLaundryExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
浆洗房的蒸汽把窗玻璃糊成一片白。木盆里的水泛着皂角沫，<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>抱着一摞床单从走廊那头过来，下巴抵在布堆上。
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobLaundry>>
你换下的袖套搭在盆沿，手背被热水泡得发皱。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>说今天的床单已经晾完了。
<<elseif ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 3>>
装订台的抽屉没锁，里面放着你的围裙和一把小锥子。旧书摊那边又送来一摞脱线的硬壳书。
<<else>>
<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把床单放进盆里，皂角沫漫过手背：「先熨这一批，旧书摊的账可以晚点算。」
<</if>>
<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobLaundry)>>
	<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Laundry Winter">><<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Laundry Rain">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "winter">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Laundry Winter">>
	<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Laundry Festival">>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	晾衣绳上的床单收得比平时早，屋里更闷。
<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>
	走廊只剩浆洗房这一盏灯，水声显得很响。
<</if>>
<<if ($upperwet or 0) gte 1>>
	你身上的衣服也湿了，<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>让你先去换一件干的。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 2>>
	多瑙河街温泉桑拿房定期把成捆的浴巾送来浆洗，管事给你多算了一份包月抽成。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobTailorCount or 0) gte 6>>
	高街裁缝铺送来了上好的亚麻衬边与蜡线，装订旧书时比往常顺手得多。
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 6>>石炉面包房每日早班都会捎来细腻的小麦淀粉浆料与院童们的热早点。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Laundry">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Laundry">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobLaundrySuspended or 0) is 1>>
	管事把你的袖套收走了。你被停了班，得先去浆洗房把话说明白。
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[找管事说理 (0:03)|MP Job Punishment Laundry 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobLaundry)>>
	<<mptailoricon>><<link [[系袖套干活 (1:00)|MP Job Laundry Shift]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[看旧书摊账 (0:03)|MP Job Laundry Upgrade]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
浆洗房已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Laundry Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobLaundrySuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Laundry">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobLaundryExp to ($mpJobLaundryExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobLaundryLevel to ($mpJobLaundryExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobLaundryLevel gte 2 and ($mpJobLaundryPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryDiscount to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobLaundryLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobLaundryPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryBench to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobLaundryLevel gte 4 and ($mpJobLaundryPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryBook to 1>><</if>>
<<set _supplyBonus to ((($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 2 ? 120 : 0) + (($mpJobTailorCount or 0) gte 6 ? 120 : 0))>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回浆洗案台 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobLaundry>>
	孤儿院浆洗房今日的床单已经熨平叠好，铜熨斗彻底放凉。
<<else>>
	熨斗压过湿布，白汽嘶地窜起来。走廊尽头传来孩子跑过的脚步声。旧书摊那边堆着待修的硬壳书，书脊的线已经松了。
	<br><br>
	<<mptailoricon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 3>><<link [[熨烫床单 (1:00)|MP Job Laundry Settle]]>><<set _skill to ($housekeeping or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 250 or ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 3 or random(160, 260) lte (_skill + ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobLaundryExp to ($mpJobLaundryExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobLaundryLevel to ($mpJobLaundryExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (240 + ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) * 45 + Math.floor(_skill / 6)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你把床单边角抻平，熨斗一路推过去，水痕在热气里散干净。" + ((mpNpcMet("Robin")) ? "罗宾" : "熟识的院童") + "在旁边叠布，顺手替你擦了把汗。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 2>><<stress -1>><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<if ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_laundry_lv3")>><<money 400>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "熨斗停得太久，床单上留下一块焦黄的印子。管事看了一眼，把焦掉的床单收走，这班没有工钱。">><<stress 3>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobLaundry to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[熨烫床单 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "熨烫床单">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管装订台钥匙）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpreadicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 180 or ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 3>><<link [[装订旧书 (1:00)|MP Job Laundry Settle]]>><<set _skill to ($english or 0)>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 260 or ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 3 or random(160, 270) lte (_skill + ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) * 35 - (($tiredness or 0) gte 1600 ? 60 : 0)))>><<set $mpJobLaundryExp to ($mpJobLaundryExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobLaundryLevel to ($mpJobLaundryExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _pay to 4 * (260 + ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) * 50 + Math.floor(_skill / 5)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你把松脱的书脊拆开，重新穿线，再用浆糊把布面压平。摊主翻了翻，把书放回架子时多给了几枚铜板。">><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<englishskill 1 "no_star">><<tiredness 2>><<if ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 3>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_laundry_lv3_keepsake")>><<money 400>><<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 1>><</if>><</if>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "线拉得太紧，书脊被你勒出一道裂口。摊主把书收回去，这班没有工钱。">><<stress 3>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobLaundry to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[装订旧书 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "装订旧书">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管装订台钥匙）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 200 or ($science or 0) gte 200 or ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link [[草木去渍 (1:00)|MP Job Laundry Settle]]>><<set _skill to Math.max(($tending or 0), ($science or 0))>><<set _ok to (_skill gte 250 or ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 3 or random(160, 260) lte (_skill + ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) * 35))>><<set $mpJobLaundryExp to ($mpJobLaundryExp or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpJobLaundryLevel to ($mpJobLaundryExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<if _ok>><<set _tier to (_skill gte 310 or ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 4 ? 3 : 2)>><<set _pay to 4 * (250 + _tier * 30 + ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) * 50 + Math.floor(_skill / 5)) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你按棉麻、真丝与神殿白法衣分三档调配草木灰与柠檬皂液，连最顽固的烛泪与墨渍都退得干干净净，西蒙执事与彭斯先生赞不绝口。" : "你兑准温皂水搓去领口污渍，晾起的衣物洁白清香。")>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 2>><<set $mpJobReg_Laundry_2 to ($mpJobReg_Laundry_2 or 0) + 1>><<else>><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>><<set $mpJobResultText to "皂液兑得过浓，洗完的衬衫还留着一圈白皂印，管事让你重新漂洗三遍，这班没有工钱。">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobLaundry to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<<else>><<link [[草木去渍 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "草木去渍">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[送洗好床单 (1:00)|MP Job Laundry Settle]]>><<set _pay to 4 * (200 + ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) * 35) + _supplyBonus>><<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<set $mpJobResultText to "你抱着还带余温的床单穿过走廊，一间间铺好。楼梯扶手上的漆被摸得发亮，脚下没有停。">><<set $mpJobLaundryExp to ($mpJobLaundryExp or 0) + 1>><<set $mpJobLaundryLevel to ($mpJobLaundryExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<money Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>><<housekeeping 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobLaundry to 1>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Laundry Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Laundry">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobLaundryExp to ($mpJobLaundryExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobLaundryLevel to ($mpJobLaundryExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<if $mpJobLaundryLevel gte 2 and ($mpJobLaundryPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryDiscount to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobLaundryLevel gte 3 and ($mpJobLaundryPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryBench to 1>><</if>><<if $mpJobLaundryLevel gte 4 and ($mpJobLaundryPenalty or 0) is 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryBook to 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpJobResultText>>
	<<print $mpJobResultText>>
	<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
		管事把约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor($mpJobResultPay / 100)>></span> 记在你的工钱上。
		<br><br>
		<<if !$mpJobResultMilestone and (($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) lte ($mpJobLaundryLastLevel or 0))>><<if random(1, 3) is 1 and (Time.season is "spring" or Time.season is "summer")>><<if Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Laundry Spring">><<else>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Laundry Summer">><</if>><<else>><<set _rj to random(1, 3)>><<if _rj is 1>><<include "MP Job Random Laundry">><<elseif _rj is 2>><<include "MP Job Random Laundry 1">><<else>><<include "MP Job Random Laundry 2">><</if>><</if>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobLaundryStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobLaundryStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobLaundryStrike - 1)>><</if>>
		<<if ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gt ($mpJobLaundryLastLevel or 0)>>
			<br><br>
			<<if $mpJobLaundryLevel is 1>>你熨过的床单不再留水痕，浆洗房的价目表上多了你的「内部价」。<<elseif $mpJobLaundryLevel is 2>>你拿到装订台钥匙，脱线的旧书开始由你经手。<<elseif $mpJobLaundryLevel is 3>>你能悄悄藏下一本待修的旧书。<<elseif $mpJobLaundryLevel is 4>>旧书摊的装订委托归你。<<else>>管事把钥匙串放在你手边，说这间浆洗房迟早交给你。<</if>>
			<<set $mpJobLaundryLastLevel to $mpJobLaundryLevel>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $mpJobResultMilestone>>
			<br><br>
			管事把装订台的抽屉钥匙交给你，说以后旧书摊的活由你经手。
			<<set $mpJobResultMilestone to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if !($daily and $daily.mpJobLaundryEncounter)>>
			浆洗房走廊外传来急促的脚步声，来取布草的主顾正站在交接案前。
			<br>
			<<investigateicon>><<link [[晾棚外有人催 (0:05)|MP Job Laundry Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<mpreadicon>><<link [[看旧书摊账 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry Upgrade]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<walkicon>>		<<getouticon>><<link [[返回浆洗台 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobLaundryStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobLaundryStrike or 0) + 1)>><<if $mpJobLaundryStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobLaundrySuspended to 1>><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $mpJobLaundryStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Laundry 1">><<elseif $mpJobLaundryStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Laundry 2">><<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Laundry 3">><</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link "去浆房认罚 (0:03)">><<set _pun to "MP Job Punishment Laundry " + ($mpJobLaundryStrike or 1)>><<pass 3>><<goto _pun>><</link>>
		<br>
				<<link [[返回浆洗台 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<<else>>
	晾衣绳上的床单已经收走了。浆洗房只剩下一股温热的皂角味。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回孤儿院 (0:08)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Laundry Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobLaundryExp to ($mpJobLaundryExp or 0)>><<set $mpJobLaundryLevel to ($mpJobLaundryExp gte 21 ? 5 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobLaundryExp gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
旧书摊的账本压在装订台角落，纸页被浆糊粘住了几处。管事用指甲把其中一页挑开，让你看清这个月的进出。
<br><br>
<<if $mpJobLaundryLevel is 0>>
	你还在学熨边。管事让你先熨床单，别碰旧书摊的硬壳书。
<<elseif $mpJobLaundryLevel is 1>>
	你熨过的床单不再留水痕。浆洗房的价目表上，你的名字旁写着「内部价」。
<<elseif $mpJobLaundryLevel is 2>>
	你拿到装订台钥匙。脱线的旧书开始由你经手。
<<elseif $mpJobLaundryLevel is 3>>
	书架底层那些无人认领的善本残卷，管理员默许你带回房里慢慢研读。
<<elseif $mpJobLaundryLevel is 4>>
	整条街书铺的古籍锁线活计都认准了你的手艺。管事说这间浆洗房迟早交给你。
<<else>>
	账本上的活计你全接过了。管事把钥匙串放在你手边。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobLaundryDiscount or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobLaundryPenalty or 0) is 0>>浆洗房的木牌后特意为你留出了免收工本费的内部账格。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobLaundryBook or 0) is 1 and ($mpJobLaundryPenalty or 0) is 0>>装订台最下层压着一本你藏起来的旧书，书页还带着浆糊味。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Laundry">>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回浆洗房 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看浆房当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Laundry Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobLaundryExp or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryLaundry or 0) lt 3>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[修补旧膳食账 (0:06)|MP Job Story Laundry 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
